  "overviews": {
    "zh-CN": "提供 HTTP Web 服务器能力，基于 Axum 框架。支持启动/停止服务器、请求轮询与响应、JSON响应、文件响应、重定向、CORS、静态文件服务、超时配置等完整功能。",
    "en-US": "HTTP web server powered by Axum. Supports server lifecycle, request polling & response, JSON/file responses, redirects, CORS, static serving, and timeout config."
  },
